### META
directory_path: install/_webui.sh/backend/sections
description: Modular configuration section directories for DINS WebUI backend
created: 2025-01-28
modified: 2025-11-29
status: active
notes: Sections are auto-discovered by app.py at startup. Each section must have routes.py and section.json.

### DIRECTORIES
admin_security/ | Admin authentication, password setup, security settings
audio_stack/ | Audio service stack configuration
cluster_swarm/ | Docker Swarm cluster configuration
devices_audio/ | Audio device discovery and configuration
devices_bluetooth/ | Bluetooth device discovery and pairing
devices_other/ | Other device types configuration
devices_video/ | Video/camera device configuration
enhancements_stack/ | Enhancement services configuration
llm_cloud/ | Cloud LLM provider configuration
llm_local/ | Local LLM provider configuration
mobile_stack/ | Mobile app integration configuration
network_ssh/ | Network scanning and SSH node discovery
nodes_selection/ | Node selection and role assignment
services/ | Swarm service management per PART 9
stt_engine/ | Speech-to-Text engine selection and configuration
stt_input/ | STT input sources and microphone configuration
tts_routing/ | Text-to-Speech output routing configuration
vpn_mesh_stack/ | VPN and mesh networking configuration
web_stack/ | Web services stack configuration

### SECTION_STRUCTURE
Each section directory contains:
- section.json: Metadata (id, title, order, category)
- routes.py: Flask blueprint with API routes
- .index: Section documentation

### AUTO_DISCOVERY
app.py discovers sections by:
1. Scanning this directory for subdirectories
2. Loading section.json for metadata
3. Importing routes.py blueprints
4. Registering under /api/<section_id>/
